<main id="main">
<header class="intro">
<div class="intro-copy">
<h1>Oscar Gilg</h1>
<p>I work on accelerating beneficial capabilities for making AI go well, mainly through building good evals to measure these capabilities. </p>
<p>I’m particularly excited about helping make AI better at philosophy, and conceptual alignment science. I also think we should make the most of AI labour in the near term for alignment auditing and AI incident investigations. And I’m also excited about making it easier for humans to oversee agents, for example by measuring honesty and how well they write. </p>
</div>
<div class="portrait-links">
<Image src={profile} alt="Oscar Gilg" width={400} widths={[200, 320, 400, 640]} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 180px, 220px" loading="eager" class="portrait" />
<nav aria-label="Profile links">
<a href="/cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="CV (PDF, opens in a new tab)"><Icon name="mdi:file-document-outline" aria-hidden="true" />CV</a>
